{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02—S05：在舍不得从前的自在、亲近，与提醒自己受过的气、坚持离开之间摆动。S03—S04从怀念转向盼望照旧、怀疑离开是否正确，S05又回到不服气和失落。\",\n    \"S07—S10：因孤单而想回去，想到回去可能重新受委屈又退缩。S08借回忆取暖，S09追问自己想回去的真正原因，S10进一步确认怀念的究竟是什么，并看到回去未必能恢复亲近。这一轮反复有逐步辨析。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02—S05：在怀念过去的好日子与提醒自己受过的委屈之间反复摆动，S03—S04盼望恢复从前，S05又回到不服气和失落。\",\n    \"S06—S08：S06已经通过独自面对难事，认识到陪伴的价值，并从回忆中获得暖意；S07又陷入对孤单的恐惧，S08再次借过去的亲近取暖，随后又回到回忆无法陪伴自己的焦虑，情绪基本绕回原处。\",\n    \"S07—S10：反复在想找回亲近、害怕重新受委屈之间摆动。S09追问想回去究竟是怀念生活还是需要陪伴，S10再确认怀念的是被当作自己人的感觉，方向有所深入，但前面的去留纠结仍有重复。\",\n    \"S13：重新出现往后会孤单、不知道何时才能有人亲近的担忧，与S06—S08已经出现过的孤单焦虑重叠。相比之下，这里没有像X那样把反复转化为一个更明确的未来行为边界。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条都有怀念亲近与拒绝委屈之间的反复，但X在S08、S11、S13逐步把回忆与是否回头分开，并形成不再为留住亲近而忍受委屈的边界。Y则在S08和S13再次回到已经出现过的孤单焦虑，虽然结尾也走向自我承担，但中间的情绪回摆更多。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "50d07cce-5f46-4494-a6da-9950ea74eede", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T084754875320Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:48:55.808484+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8084a883e65dbcae32e7f67e8bc929e3c6ccbd1d79fa962f43b695d351eaf831", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T084754875320Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "792d9a0c3b13c456b574828146e06a54afc4093c45851960a86648b387bad2ae"}}}
